      SC-B-003 is the only claim in this feature that spans BOTH engines, so its test is the only one that may
      reference both halves. It cannot live in Elsa.Workflows.Runtime.Reconciliation.Tests: that assembly's
      RuntimeOnlyLoadedAssemblyTests measures AppDomain.CurrentDomain.GetAssemblies() and a Publishing reference
      would load Publishing into the same xunit process, turning a load-bearing SC-B-005 assertion red. Its own
      project keeps that measurement honest and gives the round trip a baseline of its own.
    -->
    <ProjectReference Include="..\..\..\..\..\src\Elsa\Workflows\Publishing\Elsa.Workflows.Publishing.csproj" />
